@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / - Kiem tra may chu dang chay
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET /api/assignments - Danh sach bai tap
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST /api/assignments/1/submissions - Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. GET /api/submissions/{id} - Doc lai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST /api/assignments/1/submissions - Thieu du lieu (studentCode/repositoryUrl rong) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST /api/assignments/999/submissions - Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. GET /api/submissions/{id} - Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. POST /hubs/submissions/negotiate - Bat tay SignalR thanh cong -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. POST /hub/submissions/negotiate - Sai duong dan hub (thieu s) -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
